    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc1": "Type:",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc2": "  Effect Load Module: The effects injected into the module will be applied to the player.\n",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc3": "  Effect Remove Module: The effects in the module will be removed from the player.\n\n",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc4": "Usage:",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc5": "  Inject effects: In an anvil, place the module on the left and a potion on the right.\n",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc6": "  Effect reversion: Hold the module in the offhand, a glass bottle in the main hand, and Shift+Right-click to revert.\n\n",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc7": "Energy Consumption:",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc8": "  Total potion level * number of potions * base consumption.\n\n",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc9": "Notes:",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc10": "  1. Creative modules cannot be injected or reverted.",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc11": "  2. Creative modules do not consume energy.",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc12": "  3. Creative modules automatically recognize all effects.",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc13": "  4. Creative modules provide level V effects by default.",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.effect_modules.desc14": "  5. Base consumption / effect level / blacklist can be modified in the config file.",

    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.enchanted_modules.desc1": "Usage:",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.enchanted_modules.desc2": "  Inject enchantments: In an anvil, place the enchanted book on the left and the module on the right.\n",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.enchanted_modules.desc3": "  Enchantment reversion: Hold the module in the offhand, a book in the main hand, and Shift+Right-click to revert.\n\n",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.enchanted_modules.desc4": "Energy Consumption:",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.enchanted_modules.desc5": "  Total enchantment level * number of enchantments * base consumption.\n\n",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.enchanted_modules.desc6": "Notes:",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.enchanted_modules.desc7": "  1. Creative modules cannot be injected or reverted.",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.enchanted_modules.desc8": "  2. Creative modules do not consume energy.",
    "jei.advanced_little_garbage.enchanted_modules.desc9": "  3. Creative modules automatically recognize all enchantments.",
